lass="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-b94c1715">As so many people in this industry are saying and we too at BLOCH are saying <span style="font-weight: bold;">#savethearts.</span>
<br><br>In aid of supporting artists all around the world, we have developed the <span style="font-weight: bold;">#savethearts</span> facemask. All profits from the sale of this mask will be going to registered charities supporting performing arts professionals affected by Covid-19.&nbsp;<br>
<br>Theatres will thrive again, people will gather again, connecting, sharing and celebrating humanity, creativity and hope as they have done for hundreds of years, but we need to act now to ensure they do survive through this time and we do in fact still have these theatres and professional workforces to enable their doors to open once again.
<br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-container="true" class="sc-pZopv bjKdkd pf-41dc4fc6" data-pf-type="Section"><div class="sc-pQQXS iWCqut" style="max-width: 1170px;"><div class="sc-qPjXN eYzxUD pf-9541dc4f pf-r pf-r-align--cm" data-pf-type="Row" style="--pf-s-lg:15px; --pf-s-md:15px; --pf-s-sm:15px; --pf-s-xs:15px;"><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--6 pf-c-md--6 pf-c-lg--6"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-e88cc655" data-pf-type="Column"><h5 data-product-type="title" data-product-id="4757305884771" data-pf-type="ProductText" class="sc-pAkMi dDpiZk pf-3512bdb5">{{ product_4757305884771.title }}</h5><div data-product-type="price" data-product-id="4757305884771" data-pf-type="ProductText" class="sc-pcLzI gJGZti pf-bdb54767">{{ product_4757305884771.variants[0].price | money }}</div><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-e3fee5f4"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-17156bd9">Our #savethearts face mask is machine washable, environmentally friendly and embedded with Nano Zinc Oxide particles in the fabric’s fibres. The neck lanyard, means your mask is always at hand when you need it. The print adds a fun fashionable touch.
